   "exemplar": "ada",
   "trap": "construct alone explains 54% of expression depth \u2014 highest of any language measured. PROCEDURE is 98.9% depth-1, END is 100% depth-0. four of the five cortex rules are already in the grammar: named closers ARE the veto, and comments have no closer at all.",
