  "1. exact name in index -> family",
  "2. unknown name: character-trigram profile against the 41 measured corpora, take the FAMILY of the nearest match (82.9% exact, 95.1% family)",
  "3. measure H(depth) on the source -> quantile",
  "4. emit: plane, rules, pairs, words, quantile, trap"
